ex":256,"tongjian_id":"acddafa9-db0e-11ef-bfd2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鳳凰州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凤凰州","start_index":263,"tongjian_id":"acddafaa-db0e-11ef-8995-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮水","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮水","start_index":268,"tongjian_id":"acddafab-db0e-11ef-a717-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九山灣","place_name_jianti_auto":"九山湾","start_index":282,"tongjian_id":"acddafac-db0e-11ef-8f90-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"獅子渡","place_name_jianti_auto":"狮子渡","start_index":286,"tongjian_id":"acddafad-db0e-11ef-bc0d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮","start_index":293,"tongjian_id":"acddafae-db0e-11ef-aa8e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"「淮陵」，恐當作「睢陵」。齊置徐州於鍾離，又僑置濟陰郡睢陵縣於郡界。五代志：鍾離郡化明縣，舊曰睢陵，置齊陰郡。化明，唐濠州之招義縣也。或曰：宋志，南徐州領淮陵郡，睢陵、淮陵皆屬漢徐部，是時旣置徐州於鍾離，則亦置淮陵於鍾離界，未可知也。魏收志，陳留、鍾離二郡有朝歌縣，縣有九山城、黃溪水。按水經註，黃水出黃武山，東北流，逕南光城、弋陽等郡。今按今招信軍盱眙縣西南一十五里有三城，又西十五里至淮陵，城臨池河，池河過淮陵城西而北，入于淮，謂之池河口。九山店在淮北，南直淮陵。九山店之東則陷堈湖，南則馬城。淮流至此，謂之九山灣。其東則鳳凰州，在淮水中，約長十里。今土人亦呼九山灣爲獅子渡，北兵渡淮之津要也。峴，戶典翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"「淮陵」，恐当作「睢陵」。齐置徐州于钟离，又侨置济阴郡睢陵县于郡界。五代志：钟离郡化明县，旧曰睢陵，置齐阴郡。化明，唐濠州之招义县也。或曰：宋志，南徐州领淮陵郡，睢陵、淮陵皆属汉徐部，是时既置徐州于钟离，则亦置淮陵于钟离界，未可知也。魏收志，陈留、钟离二郡有朝歌县，县有九山城、黄溪水。按水经注，黄水出黄武山，东北流，迳南光城、弋阳等郡。今按今招信军盱眙县西南一十五里有三城，又西十五里至淮陵，城临池河，池河过淮陵城西而北，入于淮，谓之池河口。九山店在淮北，南直淮陵。九山店之东则陷堈湖，南则马城。淮流至此，谓之九山湾。其东则凤凰州，在淮水中，约长十里。今土人亦呼九山湾为狮子渡，北兵渡淮之津要也。岘，户典翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"acddaf78-db0e-11ef-9011-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"傅靈越","people_name_jianti_auto":"傅灵越","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"acddafb4-db0e-11ef-97f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"薛安都","people_name_jianti_auto":"薛安都","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"acddafb5-db0e-11ef-b744-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張永","people_name_jianti_auto":"张永","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"acddafb6-db0e-11ef-bf53-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"義嘉","people_name_jianti_auto":"义嘉","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"acddafb7-db0e-11ef-87c3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"傅靈越從薛安都起兵，攻張永以應義嘉，兵潰而死。豎，而主翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"傅灵越从薛安都起兵，攻张永以应义嘉，兵溃而死。竖，而主翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"acddafb3-db0e-11ef-8198-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"魏收","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏收","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"acddafb9-db0e-11ef-9b43-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"霍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"霍州","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"acddafba-db0e-11ef-a0cd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北潁川郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"北颍川郡","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"acddafbb-db0e-11ef-8cfa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"acddafbc-db0e-11ef-8c2c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"acddafbd-db0e-11ef-82f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"霍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"霍州","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"acddafbe-db0e-11ef-9158-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"灊縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"灊县","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"acddafbf-db0e-11ef-839c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"天柱山","place_name_jianti_auto":"天柱山","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"acddafc0-db0e-11ef-ba70-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魏收志，霍州有北潁川郡，領潁川等三縣。水經註：梁立霍州，治灊縣天柱山。","note_content_jianti_auto":"魏收志，霍州有北颍川郡，领颍川等三县。水经注：梁立霍州，治灊县天柱山。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"acddafb8-db0e-11ef-916a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"將，卽亮翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"将，即亮翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"acddafc3-db0e-11ef-9800-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"acddaf77-db0e-11ef-8451-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xiè","source_anchor_text":"朔將軍王燮保焦城党","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":121,"text":"燮","tongjian_id":"5d2d94c3-3672-5d3f-a527-c2ad472e06f0"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"淮陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮陵","place_note":"睢陵•安徽明光东北","resolved_place_entity_id":3313,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"acddafcb-db0e-11ef-8000-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮陵","resolved_place_entity_id":3313,"start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"acddafe1-db0e-11ef-bf7d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮陵","resolved_place_entity_id":3313,"start_index":136,"tongjian_id":"acddafe4-db0e-11ef-8a20-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"四年，豫州刺史王超宗将兵围魏小岘[时梁置豫州于历阳，今和...","context_before":"...军三万屯小岘。梁天监初，魏小岘戍主党法宗袭大岘戍，破之。","source_end_index":369,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"291c29a3-440a-5d96-86f5-bd671d8a3733","source_start_index":345,"source_text":"二年，魏扬州刺史任城王澄复遣将分道寇大岘，拔之。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、凤阳府（卷二十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"○焦城，在淮陵废县西。梁天监二年，魏元澄南寇，将军王燮保...","context_before":"...下邳国。晋属临淮郡。惠帝元康七年，分置淮陵国。永嘉后废。","source_end_index":101,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a8d18b4e-cbfc-505d-983e-4574571e9fa2","source_start_index":51,"source_text":"梁天监二年，魏扬州刺史元澄等入寇，澄分命诸将攻东关、大岘、淮陵九山，徐州刺史潘伯邻救淮陵，为魏所败。"},{"context_after":"又富陵城，在县东北六十里。汉县，属临淮郡。高祖十一年，黔...","context_before":"...，徐州刺史潘伯邻救淮陵，为魏所败。○焦城，在淮陵废县西。","source_end_index":149,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a8d18b4e-cbfc-505d-983e-4574571e9fa2","source_start_index":112,"source_text":"梁天监二年，魏元澄南寇，将军王燮保焦城，魏党法宗等攻拔之，进破淮陵，即此。"},{"context_after":"宋嘉定六年，尤焴言：白水塘源出塘山，其山冈阜重叠，谿涧萦...","context_before":"九头山[县南三十五里。山有九丘，因名。","source_end_index":59,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c889fad9-77db-5e96-8696-7f093057e671","source_start_index":19,"source_text":"梁天监二年，魏豫州刺史元澄分命诸将攻淮陵九山。或曰：九山，即此山也，或谓之塘山。"},{"context_after":"胡氏曰：盱眙县西南十五里有三城，又西十五里至淮陵城，临池...","context_before":"...二年，张永德败唐泗州兵于曲溪堰。是也。○九山湾，在县西。","source_end_index":100,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"5de9326b-858a-5b9a-9c40-5a3628178068","source_start_index":67,"source_text":"梁天监二年，魏元澄分命诸将犯淮陵九山，徐州刺史司马明素将兵救九山。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/二、凤阳府（卷二十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/九、庐州府（卷二十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"关要诸城戍，皆近县境也。今白塔、清溪，见巢县。大岘，见名...","context_before":"...有北颍川郡，领颍川、邵陵、天水三县，盖萧梁置。《梁书》：","source_end_index":156,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"10af6179-4635-57fa-b454-a4f38e8d94aa","source_start_index":128,"source_text":"天监初，魏拔关要、颍川、大岘三城，白塔、牵城、清溪皆溃。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/九、庐州府（卷二十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"任城王澄命統軍党法宗、傅豎眼、太原王神念等分兵寇東關、大峴、淮陵、九山，高祖珍將三千騎爲遊軍，澄以大軍繼其後。豎眼，靈越之子也。魏人拔關要、潁川、大峴三城，白塔、牽城、清溪皆潰。徐州刺史司馬明素將兵三千救九山，徐州長史潘伯鄰救淮陵。寧朔將軍王燮保焦城，党法宗等進拔焦城，破淮陵，十一月，壬午，擒明素，斬伯鄰。","content_fanyi":"任城王元澄命令统军党法宗、傅竖眼、太原人王神念等人分别率兵侵犯东关、大岘、淮陵、九山，高祖珍带领三千骑兵担任游动兵力，元澄统领大军紧随其后。傅竖眼是傅灵越的儿子。北魏军队攻克关要、颍川、大岘三城，白塔、牵城、清溪全部溃败。梁朝徐州刺史司马明素率领三千士兵救援九山，徐州长史潘伯邻救援淮陵。宁朔将军王燮守卫焦城，党法宗等进兵攻克焦城，攻破淮陵，十一月壬午，即初三日，北魏军队擒获司马明素，斩杀潘伯邻。","content_jianti_auto":"任城王澄命统军党法宗、傅竖眼、太原王神念等分兵寇东关、大岘、淮陵、九山，高祖珍将三千骑为游军，澄以大军继其后。竖眼，灵越之子也。魏人拔关要、颍川、大岘三城，白塔、牵城、清溪皆溃。徐州刺史司马明素将兵三千救九山，徐州长史潘伯邻救淮陵。宁朔将军王燮保焦城，党法宗等进拔焦城，破淮陵，十一月，壬午，擒明素，斩伯邻。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":13687,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百四十五 (梁紀一) / 高祖武皇帝 / 二年 / 第 22 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"acddaf77-db0e-11ef-8451-a0d3651f611f","year_int":503},"tongjian_id":"acddaf77-db0e-11ef-8451-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":4},"place_name":"淮陵"},"message":"success","success":true}